{
 "list": 7,
 "boxes": [
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 747,
   "rows": [
    "Earth, weakened by the Earth",
    "Corps' economic sanctions."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 27
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 748,
   "rows": [
    "Some years after the death of",
    "Tatsunoshin, leader of the",
    "Resistance that fought back..."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 43
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 749,
   "rows": [
    "his son Chiyomaru went to see",
    "Tessan, genius strategist and",
    "his father's right hand."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 42
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 750,
   "rows": [
    "...Come as often as you like, my",
    "answer is the same. My only lord",
    "was Tatsunoshin."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 40
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 751,
   "rows": [
    "Only son or not, I will not",
    "serve a second master!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 25
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 752,
   "rows": [
    "...You are a coward!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 10
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 753,
   "rows": [
    "! What!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 4
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 754,
   "rows": [
    "With such talent, you'd play the",
    "hermit instead of helping the",
    "people!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 35
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 755,
   "rows": [
    "I do not ask it for my sake."
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 14
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 756,
   "rows": [
    "Rise again for all the people",
    "suffering under the Earth Corps'",
    "tyranny!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 36
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 757,
   "rows": [
    "Don't lecture me, boy! If you",
    "preach a great cause, then show",
    "me your resolve!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 40
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 758,
   "rows": [
    "Splendidly done...!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 10
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 759,
   "rows": [
    "Tessan...!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 5
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 760,
   "rows": [
    "Say no more! For now, my life is",
    "yours, Lord Chiyomaru."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 27
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 761,
   "rows": [
    "...Thank you."
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 7
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 762,
   "rows": [
    "...That is our deployment. Let",
    "no one drop their guard! All",
    "hands, battle stations!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 41
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 763,
   "rows": [
    "Will this do, Tessan?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 11
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 764,
   "rows": [
    "Justice is on our side! Show",
    "them the might of the",
    "Resistance!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 31
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 765,
   "rows": [
    "You... You're Tatsunoshin's",
    "son...!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 18
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 766,
   "rows": [
    "Gawaine... I didn't want us to",
    "meet like this."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 23
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 767,
   "rows": [
    "Such is the way of war. Have at",
    "you!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 18
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 768,
   "rows": [
    "You've grown... Heh. You truly",
    "are Tatsunoshin's son."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 26
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 769,
   "rows": [
    "Your father and I were rivals",
    "for many years... We tried to",
    "kill each other many times."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 44
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 770,
   "rows": [
    "Falling to his son is a fine",
    "end... Be a good leader.",
    "Farewell!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 31
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 771,
   "rows": [
    "Gawaine!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 5
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 772,
   "rows": [
    "...Bah. That man is no easy",
    "prey. I doubt he would die so",
    "easily."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 33
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 773,
   "rows": [
    "I hope you're right..."
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 11
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 774,
   "rows": [
    "\"Lord Chiyomaru! The Earth Corps",
    "is falling back!\""
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 25
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 775,
   "rows": [
    "Don't pursue them! ...Well done,",
    "everyone."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 21
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 776,
   "rows": [
    "\"We drove them off for now, but",
    "the Earth Corps will regroup and",
    "strike again...\""
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 40
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 777,
   "rows": [
    "\"When they do, can I lead the",
    "Resistance to victory...?\""
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 28
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 778,
   "rows": [
    "Long time no see, Chiyomaru!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 14
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 779,
   "rows": [
    "Jin Saotome! What are you doing",
    "here...!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 21
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 780,
   "rows": [
    "Good to see you again! Now,",
    "let's fight!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 21
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 781,
   "rows": [
    "Saotome... Did you sense what",
    "was troubling me...?"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 25
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 782,
   "rows": [
    "I understand what you were",
    "telling me!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 19
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 783,
   "rows": [
    "Heh, I lost. Back to square one",
    "with my training."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 25
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 784,
   "rows": [
    "See you, Chiyomaru! Let's meet",
    "again someday, somewhere out in",
    "space!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 34
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 785,
   "rows": [
    "...Thank you, Saotome. I will",
    "not falter again!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 24
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 786,
   "rows": [
    "Damn Resistance, their lines",
    "have no gaps... Their new leader",
    "is good."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 34
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 787,
   "rows": [
    "\"The samples are all loaded",
    "out!\""
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 17
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 788,
   "rows": [
    "Good. We're done here. Blow up",
    "the facility!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 22
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 789,
   "rows": [
    "You'd take the whole city with",
    "it!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 17
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 790,
   "rows": [
    "How could you...! Is your talk",
    "of keeping Earth's peace just",
    "for show!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 35
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 791,
   "rows": [
    "How naive, boy!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 8
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 792,
   "rows": [
    "Tch, I slipped up... But I've",
    "bought enough time."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 25
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 793,
   "rows": [
    "!? No...!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 5
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 794,
   "rows": [
    "Is this... Is this how you do",
    "things!? Is THIS the world you",
    "want...!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 35
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 795,
   "rows": [
    "...Mission complete. Returning",
    "to base."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 19
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 796,
   "rows": [
    "...Damn it!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 6
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 797,
   "rows": [
    "We must withdraw too. ...There",
    "is nothing left here."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 26
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 798,
   "rows": [
    "Tessan, sir! There's a letter on",
    "Lord Chiyomaru's desk...!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 29
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 799,
   "rows": [
    "\"I no longer have the confidence",
    "to lead the Resistance...\""
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 29
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 800,
   "rows": [
    "Tessan, sir!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 7
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 801,
   "rows": [
    "Leave him be. As he is now, it",
    "makes no difference whether he",
    "is here or not."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 38
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 802,
   "rows": [
    "\"He cannot serve the cause if he",
    "can't overcome this. Open your",
    "eyes, Lord Chiyomaru!\""
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 42
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 803,
   "rows": [
    "Ah, this is... where Father and",
    "I used to train... I've wandered",
    "so far..."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 37
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 804,
   "rows": [
    "! Who's there!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 8
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 805,
   "rows": [
    "You're Chiyomaru, right? Then",
    "let's have ourselves a match!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 30
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 806,
   "rows": [
    "Okay, okay, you win! No wonder",
    "old man Gawaine thinks so highly",
    "of you."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 35
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 807,
   "rows": [
    "! Gawaine!? He's alive!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 12
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 808,
   "rows": [
    "He asked me to check on you, but",
    "you're doing fine. By the way,",
    "I've got a hot tip."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 41
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 809,
   "rows": [
    "Word is the Earth Corps has a",
    "\"bio-weapon\" lab in the next",
    "town. Watch yourself!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 40
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 810,
   "rows": [
    "A \"bio-weapon\"...!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 10
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 811,
   "rows": [
    "Hey, no need to thank me. The",
    "old man paid me plenty up front.",
    "See ya!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 35
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 812,
   "rows": [
    "So this is the town..."
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 11
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 813,
   "rows": [
    "What does it matter... The Earth",
    "Corps, the Resistance..."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 28
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 814,
   "rows": [
    "Are you all alone too...?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 13
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 815,
   "rows": [
    "! ...Who are you?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 9
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 816,
   "rows": [
    "I'm Arieta... That's what they",
    "call me..."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 20
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 817,
   "rows": [
    "It's dangerous to be out here",
    "alone. Do you live in this town?"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 31
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 818,
   "rows": [
    "I don't know... anything. My",
    "head... My head hurts...!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 27
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 819,
   "rows": [
    "Hey! Arieta!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 7
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 820,
   "rows": [
    "!! Arieta!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 6
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 821,
   "rows": [
    "Did you summon a cyberbot!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 14
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 822,
   "rows": [
    "Damn it, my precious test",
    "subject...!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 19
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 823,
   "rows": [
    "A \"bio-weapon\"... It can't",
    "be...!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 16
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 824,
   "rows": [
    "...Arieta...!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 7
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 825,
   "rows": [
    "I'm sorry I worried you, Tessan."
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 16
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 826,
   "rows": [
    "Not at all! We stand ready,",
    "every one of us."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 22
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 827,
   "rows": [
    "All ships, launch! Target: the",
    "Earth Corps' final weapon!",
    "Justice is on our side!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 40
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 828,
   "rows": [
    "Watch me, Arieta. So your",
    "tragedy never happens again,",
    "I'll end this war here!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 39
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 829,
   "rows": [
    "Have the Resistance sniffed out",
    "our final weapon...!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 27
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 830,
   "rows": [
    "Send out SHADE! Use him to hold",
    "them off!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 21
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 831,
   "rows": [
    "! Something's coming...!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 12
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 832,
   "rows": [
    "SHADE is down!? They broke",
    "through so fast... Fine, I'll go",
    "myself!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 33
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 833,
   "rows": [
    "\"That's enough, Lieutenant Mary.",
    "Fall back.\""
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 22
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 834,
   "rows": [
    "Sir!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 3
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 835,
   "rows": [
    "\"We are deploying GOD. Pull your",
    "unit back as well.\""
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 26
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 836,
   "rows": [
    "GOD!? But it isn't finished",
    "yet..."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 17
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 837,
   "rows": [
    "\"You have done well. Get some",
    "rest.\""
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 18
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 838,
   "rows": [
    "But...!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 4
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 839,
   "rows": [
    "\"Lord Chiyomaru, we've boarded",
    "the final weapon! Now we... Wh-",
    "what is that!?\""
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 39
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 840,
   "rows": [
    "\"Aaaaaaaarrgh!!\""
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 8
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 841,
   "rows": [
    "What happened!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 8
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 842,
   "rows": [
    "That must be their trump card...",
    "the final weapon's brain, from",
    "the reports."
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 37
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 843,
   "rows": [
    "!! Raaaaaaahh!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 8
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 844,
   "rows": [
    "Lord Chiyomaru, the final weapon",
    "is ours!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 20
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 845,
   "rows": [
    "Yes! Well done, everyone!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 13
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 846,
   "rows": [
    "Lord Chiyomaru!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 8
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 847,
   "rows": [
    "The power station that fed the",
    "final weapon has left orbit and",
    "is falling!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 37
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 848,
   "rows": [
    "If it hits the Earth... it will",
    "be a catastrophe!"
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 25
  },
  {
   "section": "story",
   "box": 849,
   "rows": [
    "What!?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 3
  },
  {
   "section": "win_quotes",
   "box": 1030,
   "rows": [
    "Do you have any ideals?"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 12
  },
  {
   "section": "win_quotes",
   "box": 1031,
   "rows": [
    "Might alone does not make right!"
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 16
  },
  {
   "section": "win_quotes",
   "box": 1032,
   "rows": [
    "What a waste of time that was."
   ],
   "row_count": 1,
   "cells": 15
  },
  {
   "section": "win_quotes",
   "box": 1033,
   "rows": [
    "For now, I simply walk the path",
    "I believe in."
   ],
   "row_count": 2,
   "cells": 23
  },
  {
   "section": "win_quotes",
   "box": 1034,
   "rows": [
    "I won't let the hopes of",
    "thousands of comrades go to",
    "waste!!"
   ],
   "row_count": 3,
   "cells": 30
  },
  {
